    "description": "What Sri Lanka\u2019s executioners do when no execution is scheduled",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/What-Sri-Lankas-executioners-do-when-no-execution-is-scheduled/108-347959",
    "lang": "en",
