    "chunk_text": "Gunmen open fire at Tangalle house\n\nColombo, Aug. 12 (Daily Mirror) - A house belonging to a fisheries boat owner in the Kudawella area of Tangalle was targeted in a shooting early this morning (12), police said.\n\nAccording to police, two individuals who arrived at the location on a motorcycle opened fire at the house before fleeing the scene.\n\nThe shooting was carried out using a 9mm firearm, police said."
